<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  telemetry:exempt static string resources, not a user-facing surface — a resource file has no
  user action and no error path. The module's telemetry is wired in the @HiltViewModels in :app
  (PenRoutineDetailViewModel / PenRoutineListViewModel).

  Pen routine CHROME strings only: button labels, section labels, progress lines and the
  required mark the client owns. Every business sentence (title, pen label, reason and evidence
  lines, state chip, instruction, presence line, every question / option, done line, the
  verifier's words, filter labels and empty copy, page title) is backend-owned and rendered
  verbatim.
-->
